,0.633,0.379,0.754,0.636,0.452,0.491,0.739,0.602,0.628,0.538,0.517,0.859,0.851,0.279,0.449,0.468,0.025,0.021,0.673,0.591,0.797,0.543,0.322,0.194,0.191,0.158,0.183,0.203,0.087],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye squints and sees a colorful sheen over the wall, but nothing out of the ordinary.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.576,"end":5.696,"frac":0.882,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":17},"large":{"start":0.576,"end":5.696,"frac":0.882,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":17},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"CYE: Hmm. Could be what remains of some graffiti-removal – the city could be cleaning the whole neighborhood up in preparation for the Remembrance Ceremony tonight?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":6.176,"end":14.56,"frac":0.962,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":26},"large":{"start":6.176,"end":14.56,"frac":0.923,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":26},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"MARTINE: Yeah… Will you walk with me around the park?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":14.912,"end":17.632,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"large":{"start":14.912,"end":17.632,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"[Walking notification]","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"MARTINE: Whenever we hit a dead end, I walk by here to remind myself that no matter how baffling a case, there’s always some reason behind it. Whether it’s a community member’s impulse, or an official with too much power ordered it personally, someone, somewhere, is responsible. And they probably don’t want to admit it.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":19.968,"end":38.624,"frac":0.964,"status":"ok","matched":53,"words":55},"large":{"start":19.968,"end":38.624,"frac":0.964,"status":"ok","matched":53,"words":55},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"CYE: Heh, speaking of our superiors… Martine, have you been dabbling in the Oracular arts?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":39.456,"end":46.112,"frac":0.867,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":15},"large":{"start":39.456,"end":46.112,"frac":0.867,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":15},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"MARTINE: What?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"CYE: You prophesied that my leading the case could result in the bureaucrats up-top bringing their wrath upon us. I just extracted myself from a vivid chewing-out by those very same suit-bejacketed goons delivering a not-so-subtle threat that our department of humble investigations could be made much humbler.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":46.656,"end":65.44,"frac":0.962,"status":"ok","matched":51,"words":53},"large":{"start":46.656,"end":65.3,"frac":0.981,"status":"ok","matched":52,"words":53},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"MARTINE [sigh] : I told you to drop it, Snopes. You promised to hand the case off to prophecy-crime if Farron Augustine’s death was seer-related.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":66.976,"end":75.232,"frac":0.846,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":26},"large":{"start":66.976,"end":75.232,"frac":0.846,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":26},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"CYE: I’m afraid I have to make you one laress richer. I’m not ready to let this case go yet.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":75.648,"end":79.92,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":20},"large":{"start":75.648,"end":80.064,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":20},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"MARTINE: Cye, listen to me. The higher-ups aren’t going to overlook this. The anniversary always makes emotions run high, but that aircaster dropped a can of gasoline with her murder story.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":80.544,"end":90.368,"frac":0.938,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":32},"large":{"start":80.544,"end":90.368,"frac":0.938,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":32},"differ":false},{"i":11,"text":"CYE: Ah, but was she wrong? There’s a non-zero chance Farron Augustine’s death was murder. Frankly, if the big-wigs were more interested in anti-seer crime lately, the public wouldn’t be as incensed.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":90.528,"end":101.632,"frac":0.971,"status":"ok","matched":34,"words":35},"large":{"start":90.528,"end":101.62,"frac":0.943,"status":"ok","matched":33,"words":35},"differ":false},{"i":12,"text":"MARTINE: And instead of dealing with the usual anti-Severing protesting, we’re also dealing with demands we fix the treatment of seers and also demands we improve policing policy. Cye…I know you’re invested in this case, but we need results. Prophecy-Crime said they could take the case away from us as early as tomorrow.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":101.888,"end":123.264,"frac":0.946,"status":"ok","matched":53,"words":56},"large":{"start":101.888,"end":123.264,"frac":0.946,"status":"ok","matched":53,"words":56},"differ":false},{"i":13,"text":"CYE: Precisely why we need to find a break in the case, today! If we provide results, the suits will be more lenient about who owns what.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":123.488,"end":129.952,"frac":0.963,"status":"ok","matched":26,"words":27},"large":{"start":123.488,"end":129.952,"frac":0.963,"status":"ok","matched":26,"words":27},"differ":false},{"i":14,"text":"MARTINE: So, you’re still not sold on booking Niyam as the culprit behind Farron’s death?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":130.496,"end":133.56,"frac":0.867,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":15},"large":{"start":130.496,"end":133.664,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":15},"differ":false},{"i":15,"text":"CYE: I’m as sold on him as I am on the gnoll in the park trying to sell me a bridge. Niyam’s suspicious, I’ll give you that—superstitious enough to believe seers control misfortune, self-righteous enough to believe he’s been targeted, willing to blame everyone but himself for his actions. While he seems the type to lash out, he’d need a cooler head to be our killer.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":134.144,"end":154.976,"frac":0.971,"status":"ok","matched":66,"words":68},"large":{"start":134.144,"end":154.976,"frac":0.985,"status":"ok","matched":67,"words":68},"differ":false},{"i":16,"text":"MARTINE: We both know people are rarely that simple.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":155.392,"end":158.16,"frac":0.778,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":9},"large":{"start":155.392,"end":158.336,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":17,"text":"CYE: Fine, let’s recap shall we? Farron’s cause of death was a collision with a Propulsor Tram, but a helping hand put him in its path. In addition, a mood altering potion was found in his system.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":158.624,"end":169.98,"frac":0.973,"status":"ok","matched":36,"words":37},"large":{"start":158.624,"end":169.88,"frac":0.973,"status":"ok","matched":36,"words":37},"differ":false},{"i":18,"text":"MARTINE: According to who?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":169.98,"end":171.008,"frac":0.75,"status":"ok","matched":3,"words":4},"large":{"start":169.88,"end":171.008,"frac":0.75,"status":"ok","matched":3,"words":4},"differ":false},{"i":19,"text":"CYE: According to the toxicology report I got this morning from the coroner and an update from the technicians who bagged the porcelain shards at the scene. Here take a look!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":171.456,"end":179.648,"frac":0.968,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":31},"large":{"start":171.456,"end":179.648,"frac":0.968,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":31},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6d972c3a6f_5-1b.jpg"}